    {
      "id": "74783575-5c4a-4f72-9f5f-1a14724cde8c",
      "name": "Template Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 512,
        "height": 1008,
        "content": "## Create TikTok Shop product videos with Seedance 2.5\n\nTurn product photos and a few true selling points into a 15-second vertical AI product video, then send it to your TikTok inbox as a draft with SocialRobot.\n\n### How it works\n1. A form collects 0-4 optional product photos, selling points and the language (English or Spanish).\n2. Any photos go to Replicate (skipped when none are uploaded). OpenAI writes a timed script, the Seedance prompt and the caption.\n3. Seedance 2.5 renders a 9:16 720p video with sound. The workflow polls until it is done, failed or timed out.\n4. File size and duration are checked, then SocialRobot sends the video to your TikTok inbox.\n5. Any failure stops the run with a readable message.\n\n### Setup steps\n- [ ] Self-hosted n8n with the SocialRobot community node 3.1.1+ (npm latest 3.1.2) and your SocialRobot API key\n- [ ] Connect TikTok in SocialRobot and pick the account in **Save TikTok Draft**\n- [ ] Add a Replicate API token (Bearer Auth) to the three Replicate nodes\n- [ ] Add an OpenAI credential\n- [ ] Check model, length and limits in **Set Video Settings**\n\n### Customization\n- Switch to Seedance 2.0 fast or another provider in the video section.\n- Enable **Optional Instagram Reel** (disabled by default) and pick an account to cross-post.\n- SocialRobot does not publish to YouTube.\n\nAbout $3.47 per 15-second video on Replicate at 720p (list price, Oct 2026)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20f9e8db-22ec-454b-8133-369e44212c94",
      "name": "Section Product Brief",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        512,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 976,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "## Collect the product brief\nThe form takes 0-4 optional product photos, selling points and the language. **Has Product Photos?** sends photos to Replicate file storage so Seedance can use them as references; with no photos it skips straight to a text-only prompt."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0835bf51-7d37-47ce-9683-da97fa2f40c5",
      "name": "Section Script",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1536,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 528,
        "height": 576,
        "content": "## Write the script\nOpenAI writes a timed hook, demo and call to action, the Seedance prompt and the caption. It only uses your selling points: no fake reviews, no real people."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ee5821dd-e076-4373-bbb2-05614c3c8b91",
      "name": "Section Seedance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2112,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 784,
        "height": 352,
        "content": "## Generate with Seedance 2.5\nSubmits the Replicate job, checks every 20 s and gives up after 30 min. For Seedance 2.0 fast change `model` in Set Video Settings. For fal, WaveSpeed or BytePlus swap the URLs (see description)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "58657b58-1f8c-4d00-ac3b-56e9e38e3b1c",
      "name": "Section Checks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2960,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 592,
        "height": 352,
        "content": "## Check the video\nDownloads the result (Replicate deletes outputs after an hour), then checks file size and real MP4 duration against your limits."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5e3d8fda-1bfe-4c96-8b82-86c6d9731f99",
      "name": "Section TikTok Draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3600,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 800,
        "content": "## Save the TikTok draft\nPublish Now with Post Mode Send to Inbox (Draft) puts the video in your TikTok inbox. Nothing goes public until you post it in the app. Optional: enable the Instagram Reel node (already connected, disabled by default) and pick an account."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c0dcabf7-30ba-4442-b7d9-71b4dee734ba",
      "name": "Section Errors",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2704,
        752
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 848,
        "height": 352,
        "content": "## Handle errors\nFailed or timed-out jobs, files that fail the checks and SocialRobot errors end here with a readable message. Add an error workflow in the settings for alerts."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "160c84e9-e503-4628-85bc-68d71e6bcb02",
      "name": "Warning Finish in TikTok",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3552,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 272,
        "content": "## Finish in the TikTok app\nIf you enable the Instagram Reel node, reels are labeled as AI-generated automatically. The SocialRobot node does not send the TikTok AI label for inbox drafts. In TikTok, open the inbox notification, turn on the 'AI-generated content' label, add sound or a product link, then post."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
